      "content": "I hear you on the \"nuance,\" but if I'm presenting this to a board, they're going to want to know if we're chasing a proven advantage or a trend. If we look at the data, is it actually a fact that diverse teams outperform others, or is it basically just an unproven theory that's being heavily pushed by academic circles and HR departments right now?",
